          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3104eb0b0c09efeccf5dfc825774037b1251ea48558ca876167f5fed455c285d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f35778ad5a994157884d17ac4c118ccf",
      "statement": "`resolveRouteScope` is a cached four-outcome resolver (ok / not-a-member / no-tenant-access / unknown); the segment layout renders all three failure states and `requireScope` returns null for them instead of calling `notFound()`, because layouts and pages render in parallel and a thrown 404 could beat the layout's explanation. Security does not rest on the choice because without a scope there is no tenant id to query with.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/(dashboard)/t/%5BtenantCode%5D/layout.tsx#L18-L49",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4f0b5afe02c2df1ff3a0c04657221a1711dc3e341fd3512a3e21f84e6734d2f2:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/(dashboard)/tenant-scope.ts#L28-L76",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:13e3710ab037b01a799336ce36f6870e8d61867dc3550f6be98d02ef71ef4912:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8b33fad353c345e4bfb7ac9080069adc",
      "statement": "The tenant-access verdict distinguishes `unknown` from `none` because every table's RLS scopes through `app_private.can_access_tenant()`, so a zero-membership caller reads nothing and would otherwise be told, falsely, that the school has no batches and be offered an import they cannot run.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://modules/tenancy/domain/access.ts#L1-L36",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e4a4b5f5c5ddfdb6ac2134561e78b1d9ca7921b6e516da652668387345323a60:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0c631d40d68945e5a49a537d9dd5cbfc",
      "statement": "`deriveTenantAccess` maps a missing profile row (`not-found`) to `none` but maps `sync-failed` and `unconfigured` to `unknown`, and `resolveTenantAccess` maps a failed Clerk id read to `unknown` rather than falling through to `none`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/(dashboard)/tenant-access.ts#L29-L35",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1a8e1e71f79b608c83601c682dcd92ef5481c14f436f5022bdf3963367d0a35b:"
