      "id": "claim_9d8c3a902bfe458b9e2ea139000faf3c",
      "statement": "The KPI row was moved off the root `(dashboard)` layout onto the two dashboard pages (`/t/<tenantCode>/dashboard` and `/trainer`) because a root layout does not re-render on client-side navigation and the row kept the previous school's numbers after a school switch. The layout comment still claims it as the reason, and the RQM action's `revalidatePath('/t/[tenantCode]', 'layout')` comment that \"the layout carries the KPI row\" is now stale.",
